{
  "headline": "FDA's records show the ephedrine sulfate supply is manufactured by Gland Pharma Limited at a plant with a history of VAI inspections, most recently 2024-07-25",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies Gland Pharma Limited as the manufacturer for NDC 68083061010 at FEI 3002647489.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for this facility show a series of Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) classifications from 2012 through 2024.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection ended 2024-07-25 and was classified VAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2025-01-15.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 33 units with 5.0 daily use, giving 7 days on hand, while Corvale General holds 111 units with 6.0 daily use, giving 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 27 units from Corvale General to Corvale East would leave the sender with roughly two weeks of supply and bring the receiver to about 12 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the inspection history shows repeated VAI outcomes but no Official Action Indicated classification, the link between regulatory status and current availability is weak; verify whether the manufacturer has reported any production delays or allocation limits.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    }
  ]
}
